 salon guideline (DM-HSD-GU77, January 2025) says salons and beauty centres must not give medical advice or offer unauthorised medical services, and non-surgical cosmetic services need a permit under DHA requirements. If you offer laser or injectables, that part of the business is marketed as a licensed clinic service. Learn more on our laser hair removal clinic marketing page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do bookings that arrive after closing time get handled?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Phorest's analysis of more than 5,000 salons and spas found that 46% of appointments were booked outside opening hours. In Dubai, where visitors may message from another time zone, we connect an AI booking assistant to WhatsApp and your website so these enquiries get an answer and a slot straight away instead of the next morning."}}]}</script>
