  <section class="lp-section" id="faq">
    <div class="lp-wrap lp-faq">
      <div class="lp-faq__side">
        <div class="lp-head"><span class="lp-kicker">Dubai FAQs</span><h2 class="lp-title">Questions Dubai salon and clinic owners ask us</h2></div>        <div class="lp-ask">
          <a href="https://wa.me/971588979925" class="lp-btn lp-btn--wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="lp-wa"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 0 0-7.8 13.5L3 21l4.6-1.2A9 9 0 1 0 12 3zm0 16.4a7.4 7.4 0 0 1-3.8-1l-.3-.2-2.7.7.7-2.6-.2-.3A7.4 7.4 0 1 1 12 19.4zm4-5.5c-.2-.1-1.3-.7-1.5-.7-.2-.1-.4-.1-.5.1l-.7.9c-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1a6 6 0 0 1-3-2.6c-.2-.4.2-.4.6-1.2.1-.1 0-.3 0-.4l-.7-1.6c-.2-.4-.4-.4-.5-.4h-.4a.8.8 0 0 0-.6.3 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-.8 1.9 4.4 4.4 0 0 0 .9 2.3 10 10 0 0 0 3.8 3.4c1.4.6 2 .6 2.7.5.4-.1 1.3-.5 1.5-1.1.2-.5.2-1 .1-1.1z"/></svg>Message Us on WhatsApp</a>          <a href="/get-a-free-audit/" class="lp-btn lp-btn--grad">Get My Free Dubai Audit<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-faq__list">
                <details open>
          <summary>Should a Dubai salon market to tourists or to residents?</summary>
          <p>Usually both, but with separate campaigns. Dubai received 19.59 million international overnight visitors in 2025 (DET), while its resident population grew to 4.58 million. Residents bring repeat visits and long-term value; visitors bring one-off but often higher-spend bookings. We set separate budgets and targeting for each so one doesn't crowd out the other.</p>
        </details>
                <details>
          <summary>Do I need ads and listings in Arabic or Russian in Dubai?</summary>
          <p>It depends on your district and clients. DET's 2025 figures show visitors came from Western Europe, the CIS and Eastern Europe, South Asia, the GCC and wider MENA in large numbers, so many searches are not in English. If your staff serve clients in those languages, adding matching ad groups, landing pages and profile details usually reaches people your English-only competitors miss. See our <a href="/russian-beauty-salon/">Russian-speaking salon marketing page</a>.</p>
        </details>
                <details>
          <summary>Does a Dubai clinic need approval before posting ads on Instagram?</summary>
          <p>Under DHA's social media advertising standards (September 2026), content that names or identifies a DHA-licensed facility must be approved by the facility's medical director before it is published, and claims like “100%”, “no side effects” or “guaranteed” are not allowed. Clinics licensed in Dubai Healthcare City follow DHCR's advertising policy, which requires a review request at least 14 working days before the ad runs. Our <a href="/clinic-marketing-uae-guide/">clinic marketing guide</a> covers this in more detail.</p>
        </details>
                <details>
          <summary>Can a beauty salon in Dubai advertise laser or skin treatments?</summary>
          <p>Only if it is licensed to provide them. Dubai Municipality's salon guideline (DM-HSD-GU77, January 2025) says salons and beauty centres must not give medical advice or offer unauthorised medical services, and non-surgical cosmetic services need a permit under DHA requirements. If you offer laser or injectables, that part of the business is marketed as a licensed clinic service. Learn more on our <a href="/laser-hair-removal-clinics/">laser hair removal clinic marketing page</a>.</p>
        </details>
                <details>
          <summary>How do bookings that arrive after closing time get handled?</summary>
          <p>Phorest's analysis of more than 5,000 salons and spas found that 46% of appointments were booked outside opening hours. In Dubai, where visitors may message from another time zone, we connect an AI booking assistant to WhatsApp and your website so these enquiries get an answer and a slot straight away instead of the next morning.</p>
        </details>
              </div>
    </div>
  </section>

